OL,3,GNEWSAHow pumpkin-picking is helping to
OL,4,Asave farms
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the Halloween season gets under way
OL,7,Fand the popularity of the celebration
OL,8,Fis soaring, businesses are seeing a
OL,9,Fcorresponding bounce in their profits
OL,10,Fat this time of year.
OL,12,FAnd for many farmers it is a humble,
OL,13,Fbut very photogenic, seasonal crop
OL,14,Fwhich is helping to boost their
OL,15,Ftakings.
OL,17,FThe craze for pumpkin-picking - whether
OL,18,Ffor a spooky decoration or to make into
OL,19,Fa heart-warming soup - means this
OL,20,Fheroic vegetable has become a regular
OL,21,Fcrowd-pleaser.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
