OL,3,GNEWSAHow pumpkin-picking is helping to
OL,4,Asave farms
OL,5,
OL,6,FRees Keene, from Over Farm in
OL,7,FGloucester, said the trend for
OL,8,Fpick-your-own pumpkins during Halloween
OL,9,Fhad become one of their most important
OL,10,Fsources of income.
